WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.858
Wuro e hyenya. Ko haala.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.900
Wakkati ɗu'um, to dabbaaji ɗon mbi'a, saa'i sahaa naaŋge ɗon kaɓɓi masin, haa cuuɗi nyaamdu njokki.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.722
Henna on ɗon nana nyaamdu, o yiɗataa huuwugo. Sey o hocci kaama nder laawol.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.912
Hokka yam nyaamdu, malla mi nyaama ma.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.760
Luttuɗo'en ɗon moƴƴa.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.266
En njooɗoto bee maɓɓe. Mi ɗon kuugal, a ɗon hakkiilo, min ɗon hokkata ma ko woni nder lesdi, koo ko woni dow leydi.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.760
Bi'i ɗon suɓaa ko woni dow, o ɗaani nder nyiwre.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.778
Le'i ɗon piyaa peeje. Nde hiine nyaami, o heɓan leɗɗe, nden kam haayre hokkan kooseeje keewɗe ɓikkoy.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.072
E hitaande ɓaawo nden, o fuɗɗiti wi'ugo ɗum.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.640
Neɗɗo ɓannginii leɗɗe, ammaa ko o waɗi to ɓikkoy maako tan, kanko boo o waɗani ɗe.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.034
Sey o wari to laawol, o torra mo. O wi'i ɗum ngam o hocca mo.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.512
Luttuɗo on nootii, o fuɗɗiti.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.410
Diga nden ɗon, yimɓe mbi'a: "Kooɗeeje njogii nder jemma, e ɓeynguure ɗaanii".

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.426
Ɗuum woni hollitugol haala gootol. Ɗuum ɓeydi hollaago to goɗɗo mo wi'eteeɗo Musa.
